  <scopecontent id="5667e64ed97e47a7f8488cc5527daeaf">
    <head>Scope and Contents</head>
<p>This series documents the grant administration files and associated program files for the Commonwealth Fund Health Care in New York City program. Each grant file often contains records pertaining to: budget and administration, proposals and development, articles and background information, correspondence, grant products and related files. The resulting Louis Harris and Associates survey is also included.</p>  </scopecontent>
  <acqinfo id="87f921b9d55b05e85bc47669953c7cfc">
    <head>Immediate Source of Acquisition</head>
<p>The Commonwealth Fund records were donated to RAC in 1985. The initial transfer of archival records to RAC began in 1986, and transfers continue on a regular basis. This series was transferred to RAC as accession 2007:077.</p>  </acqinfo>
